      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Pennsylvania Route 164 cuts through Smith Corner, heading east three miles to East Freedom and west eleven miles over the Allegheny Front to Portage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smith_Corner%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "route_only"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Smith Corner is one of eight U.S. places sharing its name, including locations in Arkansas, California, Connecticut, New Brunswick, New Hampshire, New York, Ontario, and Vermont.",
